# AuditMind frontend configuration. Copy to frontend/.env.local and adjust
# (.env.local is git-ignored). A line left out uses the default shown here.
#
# WHEN A CHANGE TAKES EFFECT: NEXT_PUBLIC_ values are built into the page
# code. In development, restart `npm run dev`; in production, rebuild
# (`npm run build`) and restart. Then reload the app in the browser (Ctrl+F5).
# They are visible to anyone using the app, so never put secrets here.

# The backend's address. The browser calls the API through this frontend
# (/api/..., next.config.ts), so pages and API share one address and the
# sign-in session cookie works. 127.0.0.1 rather than localhost: on Windows,
# localhost is tried over IPv6 first, where the backend doesn't listen, and
# every new connection waits ~2 s before falling back.
# Takes effect: after restarting `npm run dev` (or rebuilding).
BACKEND_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
